# Games for scripts/acceptance.sh: one ROM path per line, exactly as the
# handheld's menu lists it (the scan is case-sensitive about the path).
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Copy this file somewhere outside the repository and list your own games.
# Cover every system and core you changed, one game each is enough. A PSP
# entry exercises standalone PPSSPP; every other system runs through RetroArch.
# Pick a game that makes sound at its title screen.
#
# These paths are placeholders.
/mnt/games/ROMS/GB/Example Game.gb
/mnt/games/ROMS/GBA/Example Game.gba
/mnt/games/ROMS/SNES/Example Game.sfc
/mnt/games/ROMS/PSP/Example Game.iso
